{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03223","headline":"荅田徵君 · 宋之问","name":"荅田徵君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家临清溪水，溪水绕盘石。\n绿萝四面垂，褭褭百余尺。\n风泉度丝管，苔藓铺茵席。\n传闻颍阳人，霞外漱灵液。\n忽枉岩中翰，吟望朝复夕。\n何当遂远游，物色候逋客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}